#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:5
msgid "The medicine catalogue"
msgstr "Le catalogue des médicaments"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:8
msgid ""
"The house's medicine catalogue in Resthome: the medicine record and what the"
" round reads from it, allergens, drug interactions, the list of dosages and "
"what the reading of prescriptions has learned."
msgstr ""
"Le catalogue des médicaments de la maison dans Resthome : la fiche du "
"médicament et ce que le tour y lit, les allergènes, les interactions "
"médicamenteuses, la liste des posologies et ce que la lecture des "
"ordonnances a appris."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:12
msgid "Where is the medicine catalogue?"
msgstr "Où se trouve le catalogue des médicaments ?"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:13
msgid ""
"On the Medicines workstation (**Nursing Care → Medicines**), **Catalogue** "
"tab: **The Medicines** opens the whole catalogue, **Interactions** the "
"house's drug interactions. The tab itself lists the medicines in use."
msgstr ""
"Sur le poste Médicaments (**Soins → Médicaments**), onglet **Catalogue** : "
"**Les médicaments** ouvre tout le catalogue, **Interactions** les "
"interactions médicamenteuses de la maison. L'onglet lui-même liste les "
"médicaments en usage."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:15
msgid "Who can add a medicine to the catalogue?"
msgstr "Qui peut ajouter un médicament au catalogue ?"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:16
msgid ""
"The medication manager. A nurse picks a medicine from the catalogue; a "
"medicine missing from it is added by the manager, or created from the "
"reference catalogue when the reading of a prescription is sure enough."
msgstr ""
"Le responsable de la médication. Un infirmier choisit un médicament dans le "
"catalogue ; un médicament qui y manque est ajouté par le responsable, ou "
"créé depuis le catalogue de référence quand la lecture d'une ordonnance est "
"assez sûre."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:18
msgid "Where are the allergens and dosages?"
msgstr "Où sont les allergènes et les posologies ?"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:19
msgid ""
"In **Nursing Care → Configuration → Clinical Catalogues**: **Allergens**, "
"**Dosages**, **Pathologies (ICD-10)** and, for the head nurse, "
"**Prescription Reading Memory**."
msgstr ""
"Dans **Soins → Configuration → Catalogues cliniques** : **Allergènes**, "
"**Posologies**, **Pathologies (CIM-10)** et, pour l'infirmier en chef, "
"**Mémoire de lecture des ordonnances**."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:21
msgid "Does the catalogue hold clinical information automatically?"
msgstr "Le catalogue contient-il automatiquement des informations cliniques ?"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:22
msgid ""
"No. Indications, contraindications, side effects and allergens are what the "
"house records on the medicine, or reads in the official documents linked to "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Non. Les indications, contre-indications, effets secondaires et allergènes "
"sont ce que la maison enregistre sur le médicament, ou lit dans les "
"documents officiels qui y sont liés."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:24
msgid "Can a medicine be billed to the resident?"
msgstr "Un médicament peut-il être facturé à l'habitant ?"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:25
msgid ""
"Yes, where the country's billing provides it: tick **Billable** in the "
"medicine's **Billing** tab and give its **Sale Price**."
msgstr ""
"Oui, là où la facturation du pays le prévoit : cochez **Facturable** dans "
"l'onglet **Facturation** du médicament et indiquez son **Prix de vente**."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:28
msgid ""
"The **catalogue** lists the medicines the house uses. Every treatment points"
" at one of its medicines, and the round, the pillboxes and the pharmacy's "
"sachets read what the medicine record says."
msgstr ""
"Le **catalogue** liste les médicaments qu'utilise la maison. Chaque "
"traitement pointe vers l'un de ses médicaments, et le tour, les piluliers et"
" les sachets de la pharmacie lisent ce que dit la fiche du médicament."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:32
msgid ""
"Open it from the [Medicines workstation](index.md), **Catalogue** tab: the "
"tab lists the **Medicines in Use**; **The Medicines** opens the whole "
"catalogue and **Interactions** the house's list of drug interactions."
msgstr ""
"Ouvrez-le depuis le [poste Médicaments](index.md), onglet **Catalogue** : "
"l'onglet liste les **Médicaments en usage** ; **Les médicaments** ouvre tout"
" le catalogue et **Interactions** la liste des interactions médicamenteuses "
"de la maison."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:36
msgid "The medicine record"
msgstr "La fiche du médicament"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:38
msgid ""
"At the top: the name, the **Active Ingredient**, the **Form** (*Tablet*, "
"*Capsule*, *Liquid/Syrup*, *Injectable*, *Cream/Ointment*, *Patch*, *Drops*,"
" *Inhaler*, *Suppository*, *Other*), the **Strength**, the **Category** "
"(*Analgesic*, *Antibiotic*, *Anxiolytic*, *Antipsychotic*, "
"*Hypnotic/Sedative*…) and the **Manufacturer**."
msgstr ""
"En haut : le nom, le **Principe actif**, la **Forme** (*Comprimé*, *Gélule*,"
" *Liquide/Sirop*, *Injectable*, *Crème/Pommade*, *Patch*, *Gouttes*, "
"*Inhalateur*, *Suppositoire*, *Autre*), le **Dosage**, la **Catégorie** "
"(*Antalgique*, *Antibiotique*, *Anxiolytique*, *Antipsychotique*, "
"*Hypnotique/Sédatif*…) et le **Fabricant**."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:44
msgid "What the round and the pillboxes read:"
msgstr "Ce que lisent le tour et les piluliers :"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:46
msgid "**Prescription Required** and **Controlled Substance**;"
msgstr "**Ordonnance requise** et **Substance contrôlée** ;"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:47
msgid "**Do Not Crush** — the treatment refuses a crushed intake;"
msgstr "**Ne pas écraser** — le traitement refuse une prise écrasée ;"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:48
msgid ""
"**Glucose Before Giving** — the care app asks the blood glucose before the "
"dose (an insulin);"
msgstr ""
"**Glycémie avant de donner** — l'app de soins demande la glycémie avant la "
"dose (une insuline) ;"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:50
msgid ""
"**Discard After Opening (days)** — sets the discard date of an opened box;"
msgstr ""
"**À jeter après ouverture (jours)** — fixe la date à laquelle une boîte "
"ouverte doit être jetée ;"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:51
msgid ""
"**Never in the Pharmacy's Sachets** — the pharmacist leaves it out of the "
"sachets prepared per moment;"
msgstr ""
"**Jamais dans les sachets de la pharmacie** — le pharmacien le laisse hors "
"des sachets préparés par moment ;"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:53
msgid "**Food Supplement**."
msgstr "**Complément alimentaire**."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:55
msgid "The tabs:"
msgstr "Les onglets :"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:57
msgid ""
"**Information** — **Contains Allergens** (used by the allergy check), "
"**Indications**, **Contraindications**, **Side Effects**, **Storage "
"Instructions**;"
msgstr ""
"**Informations** — **Contient des allergènes** (utilisé par le contrôle des "
"allergies), **Indications**, **Contre-indications**, **Effets secondaires**,"
" **Instructions de conservation** ;"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:60
msgid "**Official Documents** — **SPC URL** and **Leaflet URL**;"
msgstr "**Documents officiels** — **URL RCP** et **URL de la notice** ;"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:61
msgid "**Billing** — **Billable** and **Sale Price**;"
msgstr "**Facturation** — **Facturable** et **Prix de vente** ;"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:62
msgid "**Notes**."
msgstr "**Notes**."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:64
msgid ""
"The **Create Product** smart button makes the stock product of the medicine,"
" for a house that keeps a stock in Inventory; once made, it shows the "
"quantity **In Stock**."
msgstr ""
"Le bouton intelligent **Créer un produit** crée le produit de stock du "
"médicament, pour une maison qui tient un stock dans Inventaire ; une fois "
"créé, il affiche la quantité **En stock**."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:68
msgid ""
"Filters: **Controlled Substances**, **Prescription Required**, **Billable**,"
" **Archived**; groupings by **Category** and **Form**."
msgstr ""
"Filtres : **Substances contrôlées**, **Ordonnance requise**, **Facturable**,"
" **Archivé** ; regroupements par **Catégorie** et **Forme**."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:71
msgid "In Belgium"
msgstr "En Belgique"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:74
msgid ""
"A new medicine starts with a search in SAM, the Belgian medicines database, "
"which fills the whole record and its national product code: see [The SAM "
"medication database](../belgique/sam-base-medicaments.md). A billable "
"medicine is billed on the resident's monthly invoice: see [Billing medicines"
" in Belgium](../belgique/medicaments-facturation.md)."
msgstr ""
"Un nouveau médicament commence par une recherche dans SAM, la base belge des"
" médicaments, qui remplit toute la fiche et son code national de produit : "
"voir [La base de médicaments SAM](../belgique/sam-base-medicaments.md). Un "
"médicament facturable est facturé sur la facture mensuelle de l'habitant : "
"voir [Facturer les médicaments en Belgique](../belgique/medicaments-"
"facturation.md)."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:81
msgid "Allergens"
msgstr "Allergènes"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:83
msgid ""
"**Nursing Care → Configuration → Clinical Catalogues → Allergens** lists the"
" allergens: name, **Category** (*Drug*, *Food*, *Environmental*, *Contact*, "
"*Insect/Venom*), **ImmunoCAP Class**, **Allergen Type** for a drug, and the "
"**Default Severity**:"
msgstr ""
"**Soins → Configuration → Catalogues cliniques → Allergènes** liste les "
"allergènes : nom, **Catégorie** (*Médicament*, *Alimentaire*, "
"*Environnemental*, *Contact*, *Insecte/Venin*), **Classe ImmunoCAP**, **Type"
" d'allergène** pour un médicament, et la **Gravité par défaut** :"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:88
msgid "*Low - Monitor*;"
msgstr "*Faible - Surveiller* ;"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:89
msgid "*Medium - Warning*;"
msgstr "*Moyen - Avertissement* ;"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:90
msgid "*High - Strong Warning*;"
msgstr "*Élevé - Avertissement fort* ;"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:91
msgid "*Critical - Block Prescription*."
msgstr "*Critique - Bloquer la prescription*."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:93
msgid ""
"The **Cross-Reactivity** tab names the allergens that react together. The "
"**Residents** and **Medications** smart buttons show who is allergic and "
"which medicines contain the allergen. A resident's allergies are recorded on"
" their medical record (see [The resident's medical record](../soins/dossier-"
"medical.md))."
msgstr ""
"L'onglet **Réactivité croisée** nomme les allergènes qui réagissent "
"ensemble. Les boutons intelligents **Habitants** et **Médicaments** montrent"
" qui est allergique et quels médicaments contiennent l'allergène. Les "
"allergies d'un habitant sont enregistrées sur son dossier médical (voir [Le "
"dossier médical de l'habitant](../soins/dossier-medical.md))."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:98
msgid "Drug interactions"
msgstr "Interactions médicamenteuses"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:100
msgid ""
"**Interactions**, in the **Catalogue** tab, opens the house's list of drug "
"interactions. An interaction names two medicines (**Medication 1**, "
"**Medication 2**) or two active ingredients, with:"
msgstr ""
"**Interactions**, dans l'onglet **Catalogue**, ouvre la liste des "
"interactions médicamenteuses de la maison. Une interaction nomme deux "
"médicaments (**Médicament 1**, **Médicament 2**) ou deux principes actifs, "
"avec :"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:104
msgid "the **Severity** — *Minor*, *Moderate*, *Major*, *Contraindicated*;"
msgstr "la **Sévérité** — *Mineure*, *Modérée*, *Majeure*, *Contre-indiqué* ;"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:105
msgid "the **Interaction Type** and the **Evidence Level**;"
msgstr "le **Type d'interaction** et le **Niveau de preuve** ;"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:106
msgid ""
"the tabs **Clinical Information** (clinical effect, mechanism, management), "
"**Active Ingredients** and **References**."
msgstr ""
"les onglets **Informations cliniques** (effet clinique, mécanisme, prise en "
"charge), **Principes actifs** et **Références**."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:109
msgid ""
"Each treatment is checked against this list: a major interaction warns, a "
"contraindicated pair refuses the treatment. See "
"[Treatments](traitements.md)."
msgstr ""
"Chaque traitement est vérifié par rapport à cette liste : une interaction "
"majeure avertit, une paire contre-indiquée refuse le traitement. Voir "
"[Traitements](traitements.md)."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:112
msgid "Dosages"
msgstr "Posologies"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:114
msgid ""
"**Nursing Care → Configuration → Clinical Catalogues → Dosages** is the list"
" the treatments and prescription lines pick their dose from: a quantity and "
"its unit (*1 tablet*, *500 mg*, *5 ml*). Drag the lines to order them; "
"archive one you no longer use. A dosage typed elsewhere joins the list by "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"**Soins → Configuration → Catalogues cliniques → Posologies** est la liste "
"dans laquelle les traitements et les lignes d'ordonnance choisissent leur "
"dose : une quantité et son unité (*1 comprimé*, *500 mg*, *5 ml*). Faites "
"glisser les lignes pour les ordonner ; archivez celle que vous n'utilisez "
"plus. Une posologie saisie ailleurs rejoint la liste toute seule."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:119
msgid "What the reading of prescriptions learns"
msgstr "Ce qu'apprend la lecture des ordonnances"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:121
msgid "When the lines of prescriptions are read off their PDF:"
msgstr "Quand les lignes des ordonnances sont lues sur leur PDF :"

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:123
msgid ""
"**Nursing Care → Configuration → Clinical Catalogues → Prescription Reading "
"Memory** keeps what each confirmed prescription taught: the medicine each "
"name read was matched to, and the physician behind a letterhead (filters "
"**Medicines Read**, **Letterheads**). Delete a line to forget it."
msgstr ""
"**Soins → Configuration → Catalogues cliniques → Mémoire de lecture des "
"ordonnances** garde ce que chaque ordonnance confirmée a appris : le "
"médicament auquel chaque nom lu a été rapproché, et le médecin derrière un "
"en-tête (filtres **Médicaments lus**, **En-têtes**). Supprimez une ligne "
"pour l'oublier."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:127
msgid ""
"**Nursing Care → Reports → Prescription Reading** measures, field by field, "
"what was kept as read and what was corrected (filters **Not Kept**, **PDF "
"Text**, **OCR**)."
msgstr ""
"**Soins → Rapports → Lecture des ordonnances** mesure, champ par champ, ce "
"qui a été gardé tel que lu et ce qui a été corrigé (filtres **Non gardé**, "
"**Texte du PDF**, **OCR**)."

#: ../../content/medicaments/catalogue.md:131
msgid ""
"Both are for the head nurse and the medication manager. See "
"[Prescriptions](../soins/prescriptions.md)."
msgstr ""
"Les deux sont réservés à l'infirmier en chef et au responsable de la "
"médication. Voir [Ordonnances](../soins/prescriptions.md)."

